---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Alt-Meat: Launching a Brand and Platform in Under 8 Weeks · Steven Vanden Heuvel"
	description="As Creative Director at MTG, I built the brand, magazine, enewsletters, and responsive news site for Alt-Meat as one system, in under 8 weeks, aimed at the growing alternative protein market."
	image="/og/alt-meat.png"
>
	<section class="cs-hero">
		<div class="cs-hero__inner">
			<a class="cs-back-top" href="/#work">← Case studies</a>
			<p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
			<h1 class="cs-hero__title display">Alt-Meat: Launching a Brand and Platform in Under 8 Weeks</h1>
			<p class="cs-hero__lede">MTG was entering the alternative protein market and needed a credible brand and publication before the moment passed.</p>
			<div class="cs-figure" data-animate="fade">
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--dark" src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero.jpg" alt="Alt-Meat site and editorial across devices" />
				<img class="theme-img theme-img--light" src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
			</div>
			<dl class="cs-meta">
				<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative Director</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Org</dt><dd>MTG Media Group</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Recognition</dt><dd>Launched in under 8 weeks</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>


	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What was unclear</p>
				<h2 class="cs-block__lede">A new market, and a short window to be credible in it.</h2>
				<p>MTG was entering the alternative protein market, the growing non-animal protein space, and needed a credible brand and publication before the moment passed.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What I led</p>
				<h2 class="cs-block__lede">Brand, magazine, enewsletters, and site as one system, in under 8 weeks.</h2>
				<p>I built the brand identity, the magazine, the enewsletters, and a responsive news site as one system, in under 8 weeks. The visual language tied them together so the new title read as a peer to MTG's other properties.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Who I influenced</p>
				<h2 class="cs-block__lede">Brand and product design, across the business.</h2>
				<p>I led brand and product design, working with the owner and president, the Publisher, the editor, and the developers.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">What changed</p>
				<h2 class="cs-block__lede">MTG launched a new property on a tight timeline, aimed at a growing audience.</h2>
			</div>
			<ul class="cs-awards">
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Brand, magazine, enewsletters, and responsive site shipped together</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Built in under 8 weeks, from a standing start</span></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Design system</p>
				<h2 class="cs-block__lede">The component library behind this build is still browsable.</h2>
				<p>The original Pattern Lab from the project, and the same patterns rebuilt recently in Storybook with interactive controls on the core atoms.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cs-artifacts">
				<a class="btn" href="/labs/altmeat/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Pattern Lab<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
				<a class="btn" href="/labs/altmeat-storybook/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the Storybook<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
				<a class="btn" href="/design-systems">The full practice →</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-back">
			<a class="pager pager--prev" href="/work/blackbird"><span class="pager__cap" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 3.5 5.5 8l4.5 4.5"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only">Previous case study: </span>Project Blackbird</a>
			<a class="pager" href="/work/meatingplace"><span class="sr-only">Next case study: </span>Meatingplace<span class="pager__cap" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m6 3.5 4.5 4.5L6 12.5"/></svg></span></a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>
